{"_readme":"The 99 Names of Allah. Arabic names and English meanings fetched verbatim from the MIT-licensed imanikurd dataset (github.com/Abdulla090/imanikurd), cross-validated against the canonical (Tirmidhi) order carried in scripts/fetchNamesAndDuas.mjs — the build fails if the two disagree. transliterations and the French/German/Spanish/Italian/Dutch/Portuguese/Russian renderings are editorial (spelling conventions and interpretive one-line glosses, not scripture), pending qualified review like every technically_verified asset in this app. Regenerate with scripts/fetchNamesAndDuas.mjs.","sourceId":"names-imanikurd-v1","entries":[{"number":1,"arabic":"الرحمن","transliteration":"Ar-Raḥmān","meaning":{"en":"The Exceedingly Compassionate, The Exceedingly Beneficent, The Exceedingly Gracious","fr":"Le Tout Miséricordieux","de":"Der Allerbarmer","es":"El Compasivo","it":"Il Compassionevole","nl":"De Meest Barmhartige","pt":"O Clemente","ru":"Всемилостивый"}},{"number":2,"arabic":"الرحيم","transliteration":"Ar-Raḥīm","meaning":{"en":"The Exceedingly Merciful","fr":"Le Très Miséricordieux","de":"Der Barmherzige","es":"El Misericordioso","it":"Il Misericordioso","nl":"De Meest Genadevolle","pt":"O Misericordioso","ru":"Милосердный"}},{"number":3,"arabic":"الملك","transliteration":"Al-Malik","meaning":{"en":"The King","fr":"Le Souverain","de":"Der König","es":"El Rey","it":"Il Re","nl":"De Koning","pt":"O Rei","ru":"Царь"}},{"number":4,"arabic":"القدوس","transliteration":"Al-Quddūs","meaning":{"en":"The Holy, The Pure, The Perfect","fr":"L'Infiniment Saint","de":"Der Heilige","es":"El Santísimo","it":"Il Santissimo","nl":"De Heilige","pt":"O Santíssimo","ru":"Пресвятой"}},{"number":5,"arabic":"السلام","transliteration":"As-Salām","meaning":{"en":"The Peace, The Source of Peace and Safety, The Savior","fr":"La Source de paix","de":"Der Frieden, Quelle des Friedens","es":"La Paz, Fuente de paz","it":"La Pace, Fonte di pace","nl":"De Vrede, Bron van vrede","pt":"A Paz, Fonte de paz","ru":"Мир, Источник мира"}},{"number":6,"arabic":"المؤمن","transliteration":"Al-Mu'min","meaning":{"en":"The Guarantor, The Affirming","fr":"Celui qui rassure et garantit","de":"Der Gewährer der Sicherheit","es":"El Dador de seguridad","it":"Colui che dà sicurezza","nl":"De Schenker van veiligheid","pt":"O Dador de segurança","ru":"Дарующий безопасность"}},{"number":7,"arabic":"المهيمن","transliteration":"Al-Muhaymin","meaning":{"en":"The Guardian","fr":"Le Préservateur vigilant","de":"Der Wächter über alles","es":"El Custodio vigilante","it":"Il Custode vigile","nl":"De Waakzame Beschermer","pt":"O Guardião vigilante","ru":"Хранитель всего"}},{"number":8,"arabic":"العزيز","transliteration":"Al-'Azīz","meaning":{"en":"The Almighty, The Invulnerable, The Honorable","fr":"Le Tout-Puissant","de":"Der Allmächtige","es":"El Poderoso","it":"Il Potente","nl":"De Almachtige","pt":"O Todo-Poderoso","ru":"Могущественный"}},{"number":9,"arabic":"الجبار","transliteration":"Al-Jabbār","meaning":{"en":"The Irresistible, The Compeller, The Lofty","fr":"Celui qui contraint et répare","de":"Der Bezwinger, der wiederherstellt","es":"El Dominador que restaura","it":"Il Dominatore che ripara","nl":"De Dwingende Hersteller","pt":"O Dominador que restaura","ru":"Могучий, восстанавливающий"}},{"number":10,"arabic":"المتكبر","transliteration":"Al-Mutakabbir","meaning":{"en":"The Majestic, The Supreme","fr":"Le Suprême en grandeur","de":"Der Erhabene in Seiner Größe","es":"El Supremo en grandeza","it":"Il Supremo in grandezza","nl":"De Grootste in verhevenheid","pt":"O Supremo em grandeza","ru":"Превознесённый в величии"}},{"number":11,"arabic":"الخالق","transliteration":"Al-Khāliq","meaning":{"en":"The Creator","fr":"Le Créateur","de":"Der Schöpfer","es":"El Creador","it":"Il Creatore","nl":"De Schepper","pt":"O Criador","ru":"Творец"}},{"number":12,"arabic":"البارئ","transliteration":"Al-Bāri'","meaning":{"en":"The Evolver, The Fashioner, The Designer","fr":"Celui qui donne l'existence","de":"Der Hervorbringer","es":"El que da la existencia","it":"Colui che dà l'esistenza","nl":"De Voortbrenger","pt":"O que dá a existência","ru":"Дарующий бытие"}},{"number":13,"arabic":"المصور","transliteration":"Al-Muṣawwir","meaning":{"en":"The Fashioner of Forms","fr":"Le Façonneur des formes","de":"Der Gestalter der Formen","es":"El Formador de las formas","it":"Il Modellatore delle forme","nl":"De Vormgever","pt":"O Modelador das formas","ru":"Придающий формы"}},{"number":14,"arabic":"الغفار","transliteration":"Al-Ghaffār","meaning":{"en":"The Repeatedly Forgiving","fr":"Le Grand Pardonneur","de":"Der immer wieder Vergebende","es":"El Sumamente Perdonador","it":"Il Perdonatore instancabile","nl":"De Telkens Vergevende","pt":"O Grande Perdoador","ru":"Много прощающий"}},{"number":15,"arabic":"القهار","transliteration":"Al-Qahhār","meaning":{"en":"The Subduer","fr":"Le Dominateur suprême","de":"Der Alles-Bezwinger","es":"El Dominador supremo","it":"Il Dominatore supremo","nl":"De Overweldiger","pt":"O Dominador supremo","ru":"Всеподчиняющий"}},{"number":16,"arabic":"الوهاب","transliteration":"Al-Wahhāb","meaning":{"en":"The Bestower","fr":"Le Donateur sans compter","de":"Der freigebige Schenker","es":"El Dador generoso","it":"Il Donatore generoso","nl":"De Gulle Schenker","pt":"O Doador generoso","ru":"Щедро дарующий"}},{"number":17,"arabic":"الرزاق","transliteration":"Ar-Razzāq","meaning":{"en":"The Provider","fr":"Le Pourvoyeur","de":"Der Versorger","es":"El Proveedor","it":"Il Provvidente","nl":"De Voorziener","pt":"O Provedor","ru":"Наделяющий уделом"}},{"number":18,"arabic":"الفتاح","transliteration":"Al-Fattāḥ","meaning":{"en":"The Opener, The Victory Giver","fr":"Celui qui ouvre et tranche","de":"Der Öffnende, der entscheidet","es":"El que abre y decide","it":"Colui che apre e decide","nl":"De Opener en Beslisser","pt":"O que abre e decide","ru":"Открывающий и решающий"}},{"number":19,"arabic":"العليم","transliteration":"Al-'Alīm","meaning":{"en":"The All Knowing, The Omniscient","fr":"L'Omniscient","de":"Der Allwissende","es":"El Omnisciente","it":"L'Onnisciente","nl":"De Alwetende","pt":"O Onisciente","ru":"Всезнающий"}},{"number":20,"arabic":"القابض","transliteration":"Al-Qābiḍ","meaning":{"en":"The Restrainer, The Straightener","fr":"Celui qui retient","de":"Der Zurückhaltende","es":"El que restringe","it":"Colui che trattiene","nl":"De Weerhouder","pt":"O que retém","ru":"Удерживающий"}},{"number":21,"arabic":"الباسط","transliteration":"Al-Bāsiṭ","meaning":{"en":"The Extender / Expander","fr":"Celui qui dispense largement","de":"Der großzügig Gewährende","es":"El que concede con largueza","it":"Colui che elargisce","nl":"De Verruimer","pt":"O que concede com largueza","ru":"Щедро простирающий"}},{"number":22,"arabic":"الخافض","transliteration":"Al-Khāfiḍ","meaning":{"en":"The Abaser","fr":"Celui qui abaisse","de":"Der Erniedrigende","es":"El que humilla","it":"Colui che abbassa","nl":"De Vernederer","pt":"O que rebaixa","ru":"Принижающий"}},{"number":23,"arabic":"الرافع","transliteration":"Ar-Rāfi'","meaning":{"en":"The Exalter","fr":"Celui qui élève","de":"Der Erhöhende","es":"El que eleva","it":"Colui che eleva","nl":"De Verheffer","pt":"O que eleva","ru":"Возвышающий"}},{"number":24,"arabic":"المعز","transliteration":"Al-Mu'izz","meaning":{"en":"The Giver of Honour","fr":"Celui qui honore","de":"Der Ehre Verleihende","es":"El que honra","it":"Colui che onora","nl":"De Schenker van eer","pt":"O que honra","ru":"Дарующий честь"}},{"number":25,"arabic":"المذل","transliteration":"Al-Mudhill","meaning":{"en":"The Giver of Dishonour","fr":"Celui qui rabaisse","de":"Der Demütigende","es":"El que envilece","it":"Colui che umilia","nl":"De Onteerder","pt":"O que humilha","ru":"Унижающий"}},{"number":26,"arabic":"السميع","transliteration":"As-Samī'","meaning":{"en":"The All Hearing","fr":"L'Audient","de":"Der Allhörende","es":"El que todo lo oye","it":"Colui che tutto ode","nl":"De Alhorende","pt":"O que tudo ouve","ru":"Всеслышащий"}},{"number":27,"arabic":"البصير","transliteration":"Al-Baṣīr","meaning":{"en":"The All Seeing","fr":"Le Clairvoyant","de":"Der Allsehende","es":"El que todo lo ve","it":"Colui che tutto vede","nl":"De Alziende","pt":"O que tudo vê","ru":"Всевидящий"}},{"number":28,"arabic":"الحكم","transliteration":"Al-Ḥakam","meaning":{"en":"The Judge, The Arbitrator","fr":"L'Arbitre","de":"Der Richter","es":"El Juez","it":"Il Giudice","nl":"De Rechter","pt":"O Juiz","ru":"Судья"}},{"number":29,"arabic":"العدل","transliteration":"Al-'Adl","meaning":{"en":"The Utterly Just","fr":"Le Parfaitement Juste","de":"Der vollkommen Gerechte","es":"El Justo absoluto","it":"Il Perfettamente Giusto","nl":"De Volmaakt Rechtvaardige","pt":"O Perfeitamente Justo","ru":"Совершенно Справедливый"}},{"number":30,"arabic":"اللطيف","transliteration":"Al-Laṭīf","meaning":{"en":"The Gentle, The Subtly Kind","fr":"Le Subtil, le Bienveillant","de":"Der Feinfühlige, Gütige","es":"El Sutil, el Benévolo","it":"Il Sottile, il Benevolo","nl":"De Subtiele, de Welwillende","pt":"O Sutil, o Benevolente","ru":"Проницательный и Добрый"}},{"number":31,"arabic":"الخبير","transliteration":"Al-Khabīr","meaning":{"en":"The All Aware","fr":"Le Parfaitement Informé","de":"Der Allkundige","es":"El Bien Informado","it":"Il Ben Informato","nl":"De Kenner van alles","pt":"O Bem Informado","ru":"Всеведающий"}},{"number":32,"arabic":"الحليم","transliteration":"Al-Ḥalīm","meaning":{"en":"The Forbearing, The Indulgent","fr":"Le Longanime","de":"Der Nachsichtige","es":"El Indulgente","it":"Il Paziente indulgente","nl":"De Verdraagzame","pt":"O Tolerante","ru":"Кроткий"}},{"number":33,"arabic":"العظيم","transliteration":"Al-'Aẓīm","meaning":{"en":"The Magnificent","fr":"L'Immense","de":"Der Gewaltige","es":"El Inmenso","it":"L'Immenso","nl":"De Geweldige","pt":"O Imenso","ru":"Величайший"}},{"number":34,"arabic":"الغفور","transliteration":"Al-Ghafūr","meaning":{"en":"The Much-Forgiving","fr":"Le Pardonneur","de":"Der Vielvergebende","es":"El Perdonador","it":"Il Perdonatore","nl":"De Vergevensgezinde","pt":"O Perdoador","ru":"Прощающий"}},{"number":35,"arabic":"الشكور","transliteration":"Ash-Shakūr","meaning":{"en":"The Grateful","fr":"Le Très Reconnaissant","de":"Der Dankbare","es":"El Agradecido","it":"Il Riconoscente","nl":"De Dankbare","pt":"O Agradecido","ru":"Благодарный"}},{"number":36,"arabic":"العلي","transliteration":"Al-'Aliyy","meaning":{"en":"The Sublime","fr":"Le Très-Haut","de":"Der Höchste","es":"El Altísimo","it":"L'Altissimo","nl":"De Verhevene","pt":"O Altíssimo","ru":"Всевышний"}},{"number":37,"arabic":"الكبير","transliteration":"Al-Kabīr","meaning":{"en":"The Great","fr":"L'Infiniment Grand","de":"Der unendlich Große","es":"El Grande","it":"Il Grande","nl":"De Grote","pt":"O Grande","ru":"Великий"}},{"number":38,"arabic":"الحفيظ","transliteration":"Al-Ḥafīẓ","meaning":{"en":"The Preserver","fr":"Le Gardien","de":"Der Bewahrer","es":"El Preservador","it":"Il Custode","nl":"De Bewaarder","pt":"O Preservador","ru":"Хранитель"}},{"number":39,"arabic":"المقيت","transliteration":"Al-Muqīt","meaning":{"en":"The Nourisher","fr":"Le Nourricier, le Soutien","de":"Der Ernährer und Erhalter","es":"El Sustentador","it":"Il Sostentatore","nl":"De Onderhouder","pt":"O Sustentador","ru":"Поддерживающий"}},{"number":40,"arabic":"الحسيب","transliteration":"Al-Ḥasīb","meaning":{"en":"The Bringer of Judgment","fr":"Celui qui suffit et tient compte","de":"Der Genügende, der Rechnung führt","es":"El que basta y toma cuenta","it":"Colui che basta e tiene conto","nl":"De Toereikende die rekenschap vraagt","pt":"O que basta e toma contas","ru":"Достаточный и Учитывающий"}},{"number":41,"arabic":"الجليل","transliteration":"Al-Jalīl","meaning":{"en":"The Majestic","fr":"Le Majestueux","de":"Der Majestätische","es":"El Majestuoso","it":"Il Maestoso","nl":"De Majesteitelijke","pt":"O Majestoso","ru":"Величественный"}},{"number":42,"arabic":"الكريم","transliteration":"Al-Karīm","meaning":{"en":"The Bountiful, The Generous","fr":"Le Généreux par excellence","de":"Der Großzügige","es":"El Generoso","it":"Il Generoso","nl":"De Vrijgevige","pt":"O Generoso","ru":"Щедрый"}},{"number":43,"arabic":"الرقيب","transliteration":"Ar-Raqīb","meaning":{"en":"The Watchful","fr":"Le Vigilant","de":"Der Wachsame","es":"El Vigilante","it":"Il Vigile","nl":"De Waakzame","pt":"O Vigilante","ru":"Наблюдающий"}},{"number":44,"arabic":"المجيب","transliteration":"Al-Mujīb","meaning":{"en":"The Responsive, The Answer","fr":"Celui qui exauce","de":"Der Erhörende","es":"El que responde","it":"Colui che esaudisce","nl":"De Verhoorder","pt":"O que atende","ru":"Отвечающий на мольбы"}},{"number":45,"arabic":"الواسع","transliteration":"Al-Wāsi'","meaning":{"en":"The Vast, The All-Embracing, The Omnipresent, The Boundless","fr":"L'Ample, le Vaste","de":"Der Allumfassende","es":"El Vasto","it":"Il Vasto","nl":"De Alomvattende","pt":"O Vasto","ru":"Всеобъемлющий"}},{"number":46,"arabic":"الحكيم","transliteration":"Al-Ḥakīm","meaning":{"en":"The Wise","fr":"L'Infiniment Sage","de":"Der Allweise","es":"El Sabio","it":"Il Saggio","nl":"De Alwijze","pt":"O Sábio","ru":"Мудрый"}},{"number":47,"arabic":"الودود","transliteration":"Al-Wadūd","meaning":{"en":"The Loving","fr":"Le Bien-Aimant","de":"Der Liebevolle","es":"El Amoroso","it":"L'Amorevole","nl":"De Liefdevolle","pt":"O Amoroso","ru":"Любящий"}},{"number":48,"arabic":"المجيد","transliteration":"Al-Majīd","meaning":{"en":"All-Glorious, The Majestic","fr":"Le Glorieux","de":"Der Ruhmreiche","es":"El Glorioso","it":"Il Glorioso","nl":"De Glorierijke","pt":"O Glorioso","ru":"Славный"}},{"number":49,"arabic":"الباعث","transliteration":"Al-Bā'ith","meaning":{"en":"The Resurrecter","fr":"Celui qui ressuscite","de":"Der Auferwecker","es":"El que resucita","it":"Colui che risuscita","nl":"De Opwekker","pt":"O que ressuscita","ru":"Воскрешающий"}},{"number":50,"arabic":"الشهيد","transliteration":"Ash-Shahīd","meaning":{"en":"The Witness","fr":"Le Témoin de toute chose","de":"Der Zeuge über alles","es":"El Testigo de todo","it":"Il Testimone di ogni cosa","nl":"De Getuige van alles","pt":"A Testemunha de tudo","ru":"Свидетель всего"}},{"number":51,"arabic":"الحق","transliteration":"Al-Ḥaqq","meaning":{"en":"The Truth, The Real","fr":"Le Vrai, la Vérité même","de":"Die Wahrheit","es":"La Verdad","it":"La Verità","nl":"De Waarheid","pt":"A Verdade","ru":"Истина"}},{"number":52,"arabic":"الوكيل","transliteration":"Al-Wakīl","meaning":{"en":"The Trustee, The Dependable, The Advocate","fr":"Le Garant à qui tout se confie","de":"Der Sachwalter, dem alles anvertraut wird","es":"El Garante en quien confiar","it":"Il Garante a cui tutto si affida","nl":"De Gevolmachtigde","pt":"O Guardião a quem tudo se confia","ru":"Попечитель, на которого уповают"}},{"number":53,"arabic":"القوي","transliteration":"Al-Qawiyy","meaning":{"en":"The Strong","fr":"Le Fort","de":"Der Starke","es":"El Fuerte","it":"Il Forte","nl":"De Sterke","pt":"O Forte","ru":"Сильный"}},{"number":54,"arabic":"المتين","transliteration":"Al-Matīn","meaning":{"en":"The Firm, The Steadfast","fr":"L'Inébranlable","de":"Der Unerschütterliche","es":"El Firme","it":"Il Saldo","nl":"De Onwrikbare","pt":"O Firme","ru":"Непоколебимый"}},{"number":55,"arabic":"الولي","transliteration":"Al-Waliyy","meaning":{"en":"The Friend, Patron and Helper","fr":"Le Protecteur très proche","de":"Der nahe Beschützer","es":"El Protector cercano","it":"Il Protettore vicino","nl":"De Nabije Beschermer","pt":"O Protetor próximo","ru":"Ближайший Покровитель"}},{"number":56,"arabic":"الحميد","transliteration":"Al-Ḥamīd","meaning":{"en":"The All Praiseworthy","fr":"Le Digne de toute louange","de":"Der Lobenswürdige","es":"El Digno de alabanza","it":"Il Degno di lode","nl":"De Lofwaardige","pt":"O Digno de louvor","ru":"Достохвальный"}},{"number":57,"arabic":"المحصي","transliteration":"Al-Muḥṣī","meaning":{"en":"The Accounter, The Numberer of All","fr":"Celui qui dénombre tout","de":"Der alles Zählende","es":"El que todo lo enumera","it":"Colui che tutto conta","nl":"De Opsommer van alles","pt":"O que tudo enumera","ru":"Исчисляющий всё"}},{"number":58,"arabic":"المبدئ","transliteration":"Al-Mubdi'","meaning":{"en":"The Originator, The Producer, The Initiator","fr":"Celui qui commence la création","de":"Der die Schöpfung beginnt","es":"El que inicia la creación","it":"Colui che inizia la creazione","nl":"De Aanvanger van de schepping","pt":"O que inicia a criação","ru":"Начинающий творение"}},{"number":59,"arabic":"المعيد","transliteration":"Al-Mu'īd","meaning":{"en":"The Restorer, The Reinstater Who Brings Back All","fr":"Celui qui la recommence","de":"Der sie wiederholt","es":"El que la repite","it":"Colui che la rinnova","nl":"De Hernieuwer ervan","pt":"O que a repete","ru":"Возобновляющий его"}},{"number":60,"arabic":"المحيي","transliteration":"Al-Muḥyī","meaning":{"en":"The Giver of Life","fr":"Celui qui donne la vie","de":"Der Leben gibt","es":"El que da la vida","it":"Colui che dà la vita","nl":"De Levengever","pt":"O que dá a vida","ru":"Дарующий жизнь"}},{"number":61,"arabic":"المميت","transliteration":"Al-Mumīt","meaning":{"en":"The Destroyer, The Bringer of Death","fr":"Celui qui donne la mort","de":"Der den Tod gibt","es":"El que da la muerte","it":"Colui che dà la morte","nl":"De Doodgever","pt":"O que dá a morte","ru":"Умерщвляющий"}},{"number":62,"arabic":"الحي","transliteration":"Al-Ḥayy","meaning":{"en":"The Living","fr":"Le Vivant","de":"Der Lebendige","es":"El Viviente","it":"Il Vivente","nl":"De Levende","pt":"O Vivente","ru":"Живой"}},{"number":63,"arabic":"القيوم","transliteration":"Al-Qayyūm","meaning":{"en":"The Subsisting, The Guardian","fr":"Celui qui subsiste par Lui-même","de":"Der aus sich selbst Bestehende","es":"El Subsistente por Sí mismo","it":"Colui che sussiste da Sé","nl":"De Zelfstandige Onderhouder","pt":"O Subsistente por Si mesmo","ru":"Сущий Сам по Себе"}},{"number":64,"arabic":"الواجد","transliteration":"Al-Wājid","meaning":{"en":"The Perceiver, The Finder, The Unfailing","fr":"Celui à qui rien n'échappe","de":"Der, dem nichts entgeht","es":"Aquel a quien nada se le escapa","it":"Colui a cui nulla sfugge","nl":"Aan wie niets ontgaat","pt":"Aquele a quem nada escapa","ru":"Тот, от Кого ничто не скрыто"}},{"number":65,"arabic":"الماجد","transliteration":"Al-Mājid","meaning":{"en":"The Illustrious, The Magnificent","fr":"Le Noble, le Magnifique","de":"Der Edle, Herrliche","es":"El Noble, el Magnífico","it":"Il Nobile, il Magnifico","nl":"De Edele, de Luisterrijke","pt":"O Nobre, o Magnífico","ru":"Благородный и Славный"}},{"number":66,"arabic":"الواحد","transliteration":"Al-Wāḥid","meaning":{"en":"The One, The Unique","fr":"L'Un","de":"Der Eine","es":"El Uno","it":"L'Uno","nl":"De Ene","pt":"O Uno","ru":"Единый"}},{"number":67,"arabic":"الأحد","transliteration":"Al-Aḥad","meaning":{"en":"The One, the Indivisible","fr":"L'Unique","de":"Der Einzige","es":"El Único","it":"L'Unico","nl":"De Unieke","pt":"O Único","ru":"Единственный"}},{"number":68,"arabic":"الصمد","transliteration":"Aṣ-Ṣamad","meaning":{"en":"The Eternal, The Absolute, The Self-Sufficient","fr":"L'Absolu, le Recours de tous","de":"Der Absolute, zu dem alle Zuflucht nehmen","es":"El Absoluto, refugio de todos","it":"L'Assoluto, rifugio di tutti","nl":"De Absolute, toevlucht van allen","pt":"O Absoluto, amparo de todos","ru":"Самодостаточный, Прибежище всех"}},{"number":69,"arabic":"القادر","transliteration":"Al-Qādir","meaning":{"en":"The Omnipotent, The All Able","fr":"Le Puissant","de":"Der Mächtige","es":"El Capaz","it":"Il Potente su tutto","nl":"De Machtige","pt":"O Poderoso","ru":"Могущий"}},{"number":70,"arabic":"المقتدر","transliteration":"Al-Muqtadir","meaning":{"en":"The Determiner, The Dominant","fr":"Le Tout-Déterminant","de":"Der über alles Bestimmende","es":"El Todopoderoso determinante","it":"Il Determinante supremo","nl":"De Albeschikker","pt":"O Determinante supremo","ru":"Всевластный"}},{"number":71,"arabic":"المقدم","transliteration":"Al-Muqaddim","meaning":{"en":"The Expediter, He Who Brings Forward","fr":"Celui qui met en avant","de":"Der Voranstellende","es":"El que adelanta","it":"Colui che fa avanzare","nl":"De Vooruitbrenger","pt":"O que adianta","ru":"Приближающий"}},{"number":72,"arabic":"المؤخر","transliteration":"Al-Mu'akhkhir","meaning":{"en":"The Delayer, He Who Puts Far Away","fr":"Celui qui diffère","de":"Der Aufschiebende","es":"El que pospone","it":"Colui che posticipa","nl":"De Uitsteller","pt":"O que atrasa","ru":"Отдаляющий"}},{"number":73,"arabic":"الأول","transliteration":"Al-Awwal","meaning":{"en":"The First, The Beginning-less","fr":"Le Premier","de":"Der Erste","es":"El Primero","it":"Il Primo","nl":"De Eerste","pt":"O Primeiro","ru":"Первый"}},{"number":74,"arabic":"الأخر","transliteration":"Al-Ākhir","meaning":{"en":"The Last, The Endless","fr":"Le Dernier","de":"Der Letzte","es":"El Último","it":"L'Ultimo","nl":"De Laatste","pt":"O Último","ru":"Последний"}},{"number":75,"arabic":"الظاهر","transliteration":"Aẓ-Ẓāhir","meaning":{"en":"The Manifest, The Evident, The Outer","fr":"L'Apparent","de":"Der Offenbare","es":"El Manifiesto","it":"Il Manifesto","nl":"De Zichtbare","pt":"O Manifesto","ru":"Явный"}},{"number":76,"arabic":"الباطن","transliteration":"Al-Bāṭin","meaning":{"en":"The Hidden, The Unmanifest, The Inner","fr":"Le Caché","de":"Der Verborgene","es":"El Oculto","it":"Il Nascosto","nl":"De Verborgene","pt":"O Oculto","ru":"Сокровенный"}},{"number":77,"arabic":"الوالي","transliteration":"Al-Wālī","meaning":{"en":"The Patron, The Protecting Friend, The Friendly Lord","fr":"Le Maître qui gouverne","de":"Der Herrscher und Lenker","es":"El Señor que gobierna","it":"Il Signore che governa","nl":"De Besturende Meester","pt":"O Senhor que governa","ru":"Правящий Владыка"}},{"number":78,"arabic":"المتعالي","transliteration":"Al-Muta'ālī","meaning":{"en":"The Supremely Exalted, The Most High","fr":"Le Sublime",